  "bodyHash": "ecdf56ad38c286d5",
  "content": "\n\n[![](https://i.imgur.com/jocYHF0.png)](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/stained-glass-ultra)   ![](https://i.imgur.com/PZduvU9.png)   [![](https://i.imgur.com/qPdqhzs.png)](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/create-ultra-pbr)\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vbi9D6z.jpg\" alt=\"金属超极版\" width=\"1200\" height=\"394\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #808080;\"><strong>本包为《我的世界》原版金属材质精心制作了 PBR 与 POM 贴图，并持续扩充对各类模组闪亮金属的支持！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>目前已支持的模组：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- </strong><strong><a style=\"color: #ffcc00;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/oxidized\"><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">Oxidized</span></a></strong></span><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #999999;\">（所有方块与铜傀儡）<br /></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/charm\">Charm</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #999999;\">（切制铁、风化与氧化铁及金块）</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-weathering\">Immersive Weathering</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #999999;\">（切制铁、铁板、铁门、铁活板门与铁栏杆）</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/decorative-blocks\">Decorative Blocks</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #999999;\">（栏杆板、火盆、大链条）</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-hopper\">Golden Hopper</a>&nbsp;</p>\n  \n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/trash-cans\">Trash Cans</a>&nbsp;</p>\n\n  \n<p><span style=\"color: #808080;\"><strong>Metals Ultra 专为 <a style=\"color: #808080;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/shader/complementary-reimagined\">Complementary Reimagined</a> 打造，但任何支持 labPBR 格式的着色器均应能正常工作。</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #f0f;\"><span style=\"color: #c9f;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">应兼容自 1.8 以来的所有《我的世界》版本，“不兼容”提示可安全忽略。请务必将此资源包置于所有修改了本包内方块的资源包之上方！请注意，本包仅提供着色器贴图支持，若您不使用着色器，则不会产生任何视觉效果！</span><br /></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hwavd0i.png\" alt=\"金属超极版\" width=\"1120\" height=\"388\" /></p>",
